---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base>
  <header class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6">
    <span class="font-mono text-xs bg-tag text-ink px-2 py-1 rounded-sm">EVIDENCE</span>
    <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold">LogLens</h1>
  </header>
  <p class="text-lg mb-4">Paste a server or ERP log. Get a red-flagged incident timeline, an AI summary, and SHA-256 proof the evidence was not changed.</p>
  <p class="font-mono text-sm text-muted">Tool loading… (scaffold)</p>
</Base>
